---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact Us | Scavland Wiki & Database" description="Get in touch with the Scavland Wiki editorial team for game guide corrections, data submissions, and general inquiries." canonical="/contact/">
  <section class="listing">
    <p class="eyebrow">Editorial Desk · Direct Communication</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Contact Us</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        The <strong>Scavland Wiki &amp; Database</strong> is maintained by an independent group of dedicated tactical survival RPG players and dataminers. We welcome game data submissions, mechanic corrections, bug reports, and editorial feedback.
      </p>

      <div style="background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:24px;margin:28px 0;">
        <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--acid);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;">Direct Inquiries &amp; Feedback</span>
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#fff;font-size:1.4rem;">Editorial Team Email</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;">
          For data corrections, patch notes clarifications, partnership inquiries, or general support, please contact us directly at:
        </p>
        <a href="mailto:xrwhello@gmail.com" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--acid);background:rgba(185,232,108,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(185,232,108,0.3);padding:10px 18px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;">
          ✉ xrwhello@gmail.com
        </a>
      </div>

      <h2>Submitting Game Data &amp; Corrections</h2>
      <p>
        When submitting weapon stats, trader stock changes, or anomaly scanner data, please include:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Game client version number (e.g., Early Access build v0.5.121).</li>
        <li>Uncompressed 1080p in-game screenshots or video clip demonstrations.</li>
        <li>Specific item, trader, or quest identifiers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Copyright &amp; Takedown Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Scavland Wiki is a community-driven resource. All game content, trademarks, and artwork belong to developer NoShadow. If you are a rights holder and have questions regarding media usage on this site, please email <a href="mailto:xrwhello@gmail.com">xrwhello@gmail.com</a> for prompt review and resolution.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
